117
00:05:17,530 --> 00:05:19,710
This is where history's greatest mystery begins.

118
00:05:19,710 --> 00:05:22,620
While Babylonian royal records contain

119
00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:25,000
an inventory of even hundreds of small

120
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,380
