179
00:07:44,053 --> 00:07:45,993
used a high-detail sonar to map

180
00:07:45,993 --> 00:07:48,113
the bottom of the Sea of Galilee.

181
00:07:48,113 --> 00:07:50,933
started an investigation. About five hundred meters

182
00:07:50,933 --> 00:07:53,273
