224
00:09:43,130 --> 00:09:44,110
a secret room.

225
00:09:45,533 --> 00:09:48,073
Right at this point, the stories told by

226
00:09:48,073 --> 00:09:50,293
eighth- and ninth-century Islamic scholars

227
00:09:50,293 --> 00:09:52,733
