236
00:10:15,687 --> 00:10:17,967
There is a direct link between taking the

237
00:10:17,967 --> 00:10:21,247
chest out of Galilee and the drying up of

238
00:10:21,247 --> 00:10:22,087
the lake.

239
00:10:22,417 --> 00:10:25,437
Because as long as the water does not

240
00:10:25,437 --> 00:10:28,157
drain, this giant stone hill on the

241
00:10:28,157 --> 00:10:30,697
it is not possible to reach the hidden rooms

242
00:10:30,697 --> 00:10:32,157
underneath with dry feet.

243
00:10:33,547 --> 00:10:35,987
In the book Kitabul-Fiten by Nuaym bin Hammad,

244
00:10:35,987 --> 00:10:38,767
in narration number one thousand thirty-two,

245
00:10:38,767 --> 00:10:41,587
another geographical detail is shared:

246
00:10:42,207 --> 00:10:45,187
It is recorded that the chest is in a cave in Antakya

247
00:10:45,187 --> 00:10:47,247
