251
00:10:55,757 --> 00:10:58,477
So why was the northern Galilee basin chosen

252
00:10:58,477 --> 00:11:00,817
instead of the southern Egyptian desert?

253
00:11:01,467 --> 00:11:04,387
When the Babylonian army besieged Jerusalem,

254
00:11:04,387 --> 00:11:07,307
the deep Jordan Valley at the city's northern exit

255
00:11:07,307 --> 00:11:09,107
